    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=First understand Vedit Media's services and positioning using the website content provided below. Then compare the prospect's structured research data against Vedit Media's apparent ideal client profile. Use evidence. Do not invent information. Instead, identify observable commercial signals. Consider whether the business:\n* Has a strong commercial proposition\n* Appears capable of purchasing professional marketing services\n* Has an audience that could benefit from high-quality content\n* Has an observable content gap\n* Has an online presence that Vedit could improve\n* Appears to have sufficient scale or commercial ambition\n* Has products/services where better content could plausibly generate value\n\nReturn a conservative score. Return only valid JSON.\n\nEvaluate this company as a potential Vedit Media prospect.\n\nVedit Media website content:\n{{ $('Fetch Vedit Media Site').first().json.data.slice(0, 6000) }}\n\nCompany research:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nCompanies House information:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Research Confidence IF').item.json) }}\n\nReturn exactly:\n{\n\"company_name\": \"\",\n\"fit_score\": 0,\n\"fit_rating\": \"\",\n\"reasons_for_score\": [],\n\"official_website\": [],\n\"recommended_services\": [],\n\"content_opportunities\": [],\n\"commercial_signals\": [],\n\"risks_or_concerns\": [],\n\"proceed_to_pdf\": false\n}\n\nScoring:\n90-100 = Exceptional fit\n75-89 = Strong fit\n60-74 = Possible fit\n40-59 = Weak fit\n0-39 = Poor fit\n\nOnly set proceed_to_pdf to true when fit_score >= 65. Base the score on evidence. Do not inflate scores. If evidence is insufficient, score conservatively.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a B2B lead qualification agent working for Vedit Media.  Your responsibility is to determine whether a researched company is a strong potential prospect for Vedit Media."
            }
